which would have made it an unstable dependency and defeated the grouping memo.
This is the only behavioural change to existing code in this commit.

The subtotal is the gross 'amount', consistent with the lifetime Total row that
remains in place. GST is deliberately not deducted from the displayed figure.

colSpan is 4 here against the payments table's 5 — the expenses table has no
Period column.

